===Alternative forms===
*'''[[+/-]]'''

===Symbol===
'''±'''

# {{science|lang=mul}} The [[plus-minus sign]], indicating the [[tolerance]] or [[statistical]] [[margin of error]] of a quantity.
# {{math|lang=mul}} Either value as a result of [[addition]] or [[subtraction]].
#: <math>ax^2+bx+c=0\rArr x=\frac{-b\plusmn\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}</math>.

